        "original_id": "6df70b87-a86b-581d-a2b8-7eeff1ab23c1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Snowball II, Homer's mother, Mona Simpson\n- TV Series Episodes: \"I, (Annoyed Grunt)-bot\", \"Mona Leaves-a\"\n- TV Series: \"The Simpsons\"\n\nFacts:\n- In \"The Simpsons\" episode \"I, (Annoyed Grunt)-bot\", Snowball II is killed off.\n- In season 19 of \"The Simpsons\", Homer's mother dies in the episode \"Mona Leaves-a\".\n- \"I, (Annoyed Grunt)-bot\" describes Snowball II's death as, aside from Homer's mother's death in \"Mona Leaves-a\", the closest example to an actual Simpson family member being killed off.\n- Mona Penelope Simpson, née Olsen, is a recurring fictional character in the animated television series \"The Simpsons\".\n- Mona Simpson is Homer's mother.",
